git commit -m "docs: plan authentication and user profile endpoints

Added endpoint specifications for:

Authentication (Public):
- POST /api/auth/register
  Request: { fullName, email, password, role }
  Response: 201 Created / 400 Bad Request

- POST /api/auth/login
  Request: { email, password }
  Response: 200 OK with JWT / 401 Unauthorized

User Profile (Authenticated):
- GET /api/users/me
  Response: 200 OK with user object

- PUT /api/users/me
  Request: { fullName, phoneNumber, dateOfBirth }
  Response: 200 OK updated / 400 Bad Request

Role-based access:
- Public endpoints require no authentication
- Profile endpoints require any logged-in user

This begins the API endpoint plan for Section B.

This is commit #8 of 20."
